# AEGIS — Host-Based Intrusion Detection System (HIDS)
## A Simple, Presentation-Ready Explanation

---

## 🔎 What is AEGIS?

**AEGIS** (also called *CyberGuard Pro*) is a **desktop cybersecurity application** built for Windows. Think of it as an **all-in-one security guard for your computer**. It sits on your machine and constantly watches for threats — malicious files, suspicious programs, phishing websites on your screen, dangerous network traffic, and even insecure code.

It's a **Host-based Intrusion Detection System (HIDS)**, meaning it runs *on the host computer itself* (not on a server or router), monitoring everything that happens locally.

> [!IMPORTANT]
> The application combines **8 major security modules** into a single desktop app with a modern React-based UI.

